  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Present someone",
   "texto": [
    "**Ini teman saya** means «This is my friend.». **Dia** can mean «He» or «her.»: the pronoun does not mark gender. **Mereka** means «They / they»."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "We and us.",
   "texto": [
    "**Kita** includes the listener («us, you and me.»); **kami** excludes it («We, but not you.»). In Spanish we use «We» in both cases, so see who's included."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Country and origin",
   "texto": [
    "**Orang** is a person; **negara** is a country. **Berasal dari** means «be originating in». **Apakah** usually marks a question of itself or not; it can also be asked only with the intonation."
   ]
  },
